* Burst-Mode Receiver Limiting Amplifier Stage Testbench
.lib "sky130_fd_pr/models/sky130.lib.spice" tt

* Supplies (VSS is set to 1.8V as PMOS sources are tied to it)
VVDD VDD 0 1.8
VVSS VSS 0 1.8

* Inputs
VIN_PLUS IN_PLUS 0 DC 0.9 AC 1 SIN(0.9 0.1 625MEG 0 0)
VIN_MINUS IN_MINUS 0 DC 0.9 AC -1 SIN(0.9 -0.1 625MEG 0 0)

* Bias
VLABEL_NET_3 LABEL_NET_3 0 0.9
VLABEL_NET_4 LABEL_NET_4 0 0.9

* Fix floating nodes from extraction errors (shorted tail sources)
RN20 N20 0 500
RN5 N5 0 500
RN11 N11 0 500

